                                                "sense_id": "a080d52f-93a3-365c-b6e6-c9d8128334e0",
                                                "text": "\"Could be. Anyway, Sumerian culture—the society based on me—was another manifestation of the metavirus. Expect that in this case, it was in a linguistic form rather than DNA.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
